The food looks like scrambled egg whites or a soft egg, in pieces with pepper, on a square plate about 22-24 cm wide. The pieces cover only a small part of the plate. I estimate about 60 g in total.

Egg is about 150 kcal per 100 g, so 60 g comes to roughly 90 kcal. Cooked egg white alone would be lower, around 50 kcal. Some oil or butter may have been used, so I'll go slightly above the midpoint at about 85 kcal.

{"kcal": 85, "mass_g": 60}
